    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/7657d3e5ab109d7f7522e419807ce670.avif?t=1750957373\" data-has-big /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmula</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced space shooter</strong> where you engage in intense battles across <strong>randomly generated environments</strong>. Play in <strong>multiplayer</strong> or <strong>single-player</strong>  in <strong>various game modes</strong>, with support for up to <strong>6 players</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPACESHIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play each of the <strong>8 spaceships</strong>, each with its own <strong>stats</strong>, <strong>primary and secondary weapons</strong>, as well as a <strong>utility</strong>, <strong>passive</strong>, and <strong>ultimate</strong>. Choose a spaceship that fits your playstyle to defeat your opponents and dominate the battlefield. Each spaceship also has its own <strong>leveling system</strong>\u00a0which unlocks additional components as you level it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/f60fed7fee5f6ab5b1f323a1f0101665.poster.avif?t=1750957373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/f60fed7fee5f6ab5b1f323a1f0101665.webm?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/f60fed7fee5f6ab5b1f323a1f0101665.mp4?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENERGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy on the battlefield and utilize it to fit your playstyle. Spend energy to <strong>repair </strong>your spaceship, gain a <strong>speed boost</strong>, <strong>hack turrets</strong> to turn them onto your side, or activate your spaceship\u2019s <strong>ultimate</strong>. Use your energy wisely to defeat your opponents, whether by unleashing a devastating ultimate or hacking strategically placed turrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/5c7414e391ffa9e24a005dded2f778d3.poster.avif?t=1750957373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/5c7414e391ffa9e24a005dded2f778d3.webm?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/5c7414e391ffa9e24a005dded2f778d3.mp4?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENVIRONMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>randomly generated </strong>environment in each game. Avoid <strong>asteroids</strong> and <strong>explosives</strong> while evading the danger of <strong>enemy turrets</strong>. Overcome various <strong>anomalies</strong>, including <strong>temporal fields</strong>, <strong>electrical storms</strong>, <strong>wormholes</strong>, and more. Utilize the strategic advantage of an electrical storm to ambush your opponents or quickly escape danger by traversing through a nearby wormhole!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/6b63a49872ee2151354ca357f7c4d720.poster.avif?t=1750957373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/6b63a49872ee2151354ca357f7c4d720.webm?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/6b63a49872ee2151354ca357f7c4d720.mp4?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>3 different game modes</strong> in <strong>single-player</strong> or <strong>multiplayer</strong>, each available with <strong>bots</strong> and in <strong>Teams</strong> or <strong>Free-for-All</strong>, with <strong>adjustable</strong> <strong>map sizes</strong>. Defeat as many enemies as possible in <strong>Deathmatch</strong>, be the last to survive in the closing zone of <strong>One Life</strong>, or fight for control of the battlefield in <strong>Zone Control</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/05f502b1ea4e72fb63931a20aaf5a933.poster.avif?t=1750957373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/05f502b1ea4e72fb63931a20aaf5a933.webm?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/05f502b1ea4e72fb63931a20aaf5a933.mp4?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete various\u00a0<strong>achievements</strong> to unlock in-game <strong>avatar borders</strong> to show off in multiplayer!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmula</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced space shooter</strong> where you engage in intense battles across <strong>randomly generated environments</strong>. Play in <strong>multiplayer</strong> or <strong>single-player</strong>  in <strong>various game modes</strong>, with support for up to <strong>6 players</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPACESHIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play each of the <strong>8 spaceships</strong>, each with its own <strong>stats</strong>, <strong>primary and secondary weapons</strong>, as well as a <strong>utility</strong>, <strong>passive</strong>, and <strong>ultimate</strong>. Choose a spaceship that fits your playstyle to defeat your opponents and dominate the battlefield. Each spaceship also has its own <strong>leveling system</strong>\u00a0which unlocks additional components as you level it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/f60fed7fee5f6ab5b1f323a1f0101665.poster.avif?t=1750957373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/f60fed7fee5f6ab5b1f323a1f0101665.webm?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/f60fed7fee5f6ab5b1f323a1f0101665.mp4?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENERGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy on the battlefield and utilize it to fit your playstyle. Spend energy to <strong>repair </strong>your spaceship, gain a <strong>speed boost</strong>, <strong>hack turrets</strong> to turn them onto your side, or activate your spaceship\u2019s <strong>ultimate</strong>. Use your energy wisely to defeat your opponents, whether by unleashing a devastating ultimate or hacking strategically placed turrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/5c7414e391ffa9e24a005dded2f778d3.poster.avif?t=1750957373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/5c7414e391ffa9e24a005dded2f778d3.webm?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/5c7414e391ffa9e24a005dded2f778d3.mp4?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENVIRONMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>randomly generated </strong>environment in each game. Avoid <strong>asteroids</strong> and <strong>explosives</strong> while evading the danger of <strong>enemy turrets</strong>. Overcome various <strong>anomalies</strong>, including <strong>temporal fields</strong>, <strong>electrical storms</strong>, <strong>wormholes</strong>, and more. Utilize the strategic advantage of an electrical storm to ambush your opponents or quickly escape danger by traversing through a nearby wormhole!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/6b63a49872ee2151354ca357f7c4d720.poster.avif?t=1750957373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/6b63a49872ee2151354ca357f7c4d720.webm?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/6b63a49872ee2151354ca357f7c4d720.mp4?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>3 different game modes</strong> in <strong>single-player</strong> or <strong>multiplayer</strong>, each available with <strong>bots</strong> and in <strong>Teams</strong> or <strong>Free-for-All</strong>, with <strong>adjustable</strong> <strong>map sizes</strong>. Defeat as many enemies as possible in <strong>Deathmatch</strong>, be the last to survive in the closing zone of <strong>One Life</strong>, or fight for control of the battlefield in <strong>Zone Control</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/05f502b1ea4e72fb63931a20aaf5a933.poster.avif?t=1750957373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/05f502b1ea4e72fb63931a20aaf5a933.webm?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421520/extras/05f502b1ea4e72fb63931a20aaf5a933.mp4?t=1750957373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete various\u00a0<strong>achievements</strong> to unlock in-game <strong>avatar borders</strong> to show off in multiplayer!</p>",
